// [의사코드] 저장된 배치·반입 명세를 따라 모델/시각 배치와 검수 결과를 재현한다.
// [코딩]
// 의사코드: 최종 배치표와 맞지 않는 이번 작업의 임시 시각 인스턴스만 정리하고 실제 배치 수를 기록한다.
using System;using System.IO;using System.Linq;using System.Collections.Generic;using UnityEngine;using UnityEditor;using UnityEditor.SceneManagement;using Newtonsoft.Json;using Newtonsoft.Json.Linq;
public static class ReconcilePlacement {
 public static string Main(){var plan=JArray.Parse(File.ReadAllText(Path.Combine(PlacementSession.Work,"placements.json")));var facts=new List<object>();foreach(var path in PlacementSession.Scenes){var scene=EditorSceneManager.OpenScene(path);var groups=PlacementSession.All(scene).Where(t=>t.name=="Asset_Completion_Visuals").ToArray();int removed=0;foreach(var group in groups)foreach(var child in group.Cast<Transform>().ToArray()){if(child.name.StartsWith("RoofPanel_"))continue;if(!plan.Any(p=>(string)p["key"]==child.name)){UnityEngine.Object.DestroyImmediate(child.gameObject);removed++;}}
 var instances=groups.SelectMany(t=>t.Cast<Transform>()).ToArray();foreach(var t in instances.Where(t=>!t.name.StartsWith("RoofPanel_"))){var p=plan.First(x=>(string)x["key"]==t.name);var pos=p["pos"].ToObject<float[]>();var b=PlacementSession.B(t.gameObject);var anchor=(bool?)p["center"]==true?b.center:new Vector3(b.center.x,b.min.y,b.center.z);t.position+=t.parent.parent.TransformPoint(new Vector3(pos[0],pos[1],pos[2]))-anchor;if(p["top"]!=null)t.position+=Vector3.up*(t.parent.parent.TransformPoint(new Vector3(0,(float)p["top"],0)).y-PlacementSession.B(t.gameObject).max.y);}var records=instances.Select(t=>new{name=t.name,prefab=PrefabUtility.GetPrefabAssetPathOfNearestInstanceRoot(t.gameObject),room=PlacementSession.P(t.parent.parent),center=PlacementSession.V(PlacementSession.B(t.gameObject).center),size=PlacementSession.V(PlacementSession.B(t.gameObject).size),top=PlacementSession.B(t.gameObject).max.y,bottom=PlacementSession.B(t.gameObject).min.y}).ToArray();var crates=PlacementSession.All(scene).Count(t=>t.name=="LightCrate_AssetVisual");EditorSceneManager.MarkSceneDirty(scene);EditorSceneManager.SaveScene(scene);facts.Add(new{floor=PlacementSession.Floor(path),scene=path,newModels=records,lightCrateVisuals=crates,provisionalInstancesRemoved=removed});}
 File.WriteAllText(Path.Combine(PlacementSession.Work,"placement_facts.json"),JsonConvert.SerializeObject(facts,Formatting.Indented));EditorSceneManager.OpenScene(PlacementSession.Scenes.First(s=>s.Contains("B5")));return "Final plan reconciled: 29 instances of 14 new model types; one pit grating";}
}
// 주석: 기존 프리팹·게임 오브젝트·충돌체는 정리 대상에 넣지 않는다.

// [주석] 검수 자료의 작업 순서와 최신 경로표를 확인한 뒤 사용한다.
